            "text": "m going to search for another if node.",
            "_dirty": true
          },
          {
            "id": "extension-1-segment-367",
            "start": 917930,
            "end": 921490,
            "text": "and then we are going to add one single constant.",
            "_dirty": true
          },
          {
            "id": "extension-1-segment-368",
            "start": 921610,
            "end": 924610,
            "text": "so hold down the one key and just left click and you get",
            "_dirty": true
          },
          {
            "id": "extension-1-segment-369",
            "start": 924610,
            "end": 925210,
            "text": "a constant.",
            "_dirty": true
          },
          {
            "id": "extension-1-segment-370",
            "start": 925410,
            "end": 926970,
            "text": "and i'm going to set this value to one.",
            "_dirty": true
          },
          {
            "id": "extension-1-segment-371",
            "start": 927450,
            "end": 931610,
            "text": "we're going to plug the one value into the b slot.",
            "_dirty": true
          },
          {
            "id": "extension-1-segment-372",
            "start": 931930,
            "end": 935050,
            "text": "the b is greater than a slot and the b is equal to",
            "_dirty": true
          },
          {
            "id": "extension-1-segment-373",
            "start": 935050,
            "end": 935290,
            "text": "a.",
            "_dirty": true
          },
          {
            "id": "extension-1-segment-374",
            "start": 935410,
            "end": 939770,
            "text": "and then we're going to bring from our previous if to",
            "_dirty": true
          },
          {
            "id": "extension-1-segment-375",
            "start": 939770,
            "end": 940890,
            "text": "a is less than b.",
            "_dirty": true
          },
          {
            "id": "extension-1-segment-376",
            "start": 941090,
            "end": 944050,
            "text": "and then we're going to from that result into the opacity.",
            "_dirty": true
          },
          {
            "id": "extension-1-segment-377",
            "start": 944870,
            "end": 948270,
            "text": "and so what this tells us is anything that's using the",
            "_dirty": true
          },
          {
            "id": "extension-1-segment-378",
            "start": 948270,
            "end": 951150,
            "text": "custom depth pass or any object in the scene that's using",
            "_dirty": true
          },
          {
            "id": "extension-1-segment-379",
            "start": 951150,
            "end": 954710,
            "text": "the custom depth pass, if it has a stencil value of one,",
            "_dirty": true
          },
          {
            "id": "extension-1-segment-380",
            "start": 955830,
            "end": 960390,
            "text": "it's going to output a value of one from the if",
            "_dirty": true
          },
          {
            "id": "extension-1-segment-381",
            "start": 960390,
            "end": 960710,
            "text": "node.",
            "_dirty": true
          },
          {
            "id": "extension-1-segment-382",
            "start": 960870,
            "end": 965990,
            "text": "and we know that an opacity switch is zero is transparent and one",
            "_dirty": true
          },
          {
            "id": "extension-1-segment-383",
            "start": 965990,
            "end": 966630,
            "text": "is opaque.",
            "_dirty": true
          },
          {
            "id": "extension-1-segment-384",
            "start": 967230,
            "end": 967670,
            "text": "visible.",
            "_dirty": true
          },
          {
            "id": "extension-1-segment-385",
            "start": 968710,
            "end": 973710,
            "text": "so now we have this extra check, just this little clean extra check.",
            "_dirty": true
          },
          {
            "id": "extension-1-segment-386",
            "start": 973870,
            "end": 976990,
            "text": "so what we do is we apply and save that and now if",
            "_dirty": true
          },
          {
            "id": "extension-1-segment-387",
            "start": 976990,
            "end": 980510,
            "text": "we were to hit back into our game scene and select any object,",
            "_dirty": true
          },
          {
            "id": "extension-1-segment-388",
            "start": 980710,
            "end": 983790,
            "text": "let's just use the right shape there and we're",
            "_dirty": true
          },
          {
            "id": "extension-1-segment-389",
            "start": 983790,
            "end": 985950,
            "text": "going to enable custom depth pass and then we're just going",
            "_dirty": true
          },
          {
            "id": "extension-1-segment-390",
            "start": 985950,
            "end": 988590,
            "text": "to set its stencil value to one.",
            "_dirty": true
          },
          {
            "id": "extension-1-segment-391",
            "start": 989550,
            "end": 993150,
            "text": "if we save that and run the game in standalone again,",
            "_dirty": true
          },
          {
            "id": "extension-1-segment-392",
            "start": 994070,
            "end": 998430,
            "text": "activate that obs game overlay i had before.",
            "_dirty": true
          },
          {
            "id": "extension-1-segment-393",
            "start": 998990,
            "end": 1000270,
            "text": "give it a second to find it.",
            "_dirty": true
          },
          {
            "id": "extension-1-segment-394",
            "start": 1000470,
            "end": 1001510,
            "text": "boom, there it is.",
            "_dirty": true
          },
          {
            "id": "extension-1-segment-395",
            "start": 1002150,
            "end": 1006470,
            "text": "what you can see now is that our right shape is still visible,",
            "_dirty": true
          },
          {
            "id": "extension-1-segment-396",
            "start": 1006630,
            "end": 1008790,
            "text": "even though it's using the custom depth pass.",
            "_dirty": true
          },
          {
            "id": "extension-1-segment-397",
            "start": 1009110,
            "end": 1011670,
            "text": "however, our background is completely gone.",
            "_dirty": true
          },
          {
            "id": "extension-1-segment-398",
            "start": 1012710,
            "end": 1014110,
            "text": "i hope that makes sense,",
            "_dirty": true
          },
          {
            "id": "extension-1-segment-399",
            "start": 1014470,
            "end": 1018110,
            "text": "but it's just another way to bring back our ability to",
